            "pages": {
              "end": 65,
              "start": 65
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked, \"Well, suppose an Indian is charged with a mugging in Tulsa. Where would that case end up?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e822f1390831c8d4a2868135baf3e0040f73861b12ef526bfb1733fb5ccc2f9b",
            "evidence_ids": [
