            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 66,
              "start": 66
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito further asked, \"If any of those individuals were charged with an offense normally prosecuted in state court, would they all have to be prosecuted in federal court?\""
      }
